  "term": "perphenazine",
  "definition": "Perphenazine is a phenothiazine drug that acts mainly by blocking dopamine receptors, giving it antipsychotic and anti-nausea effects. In mental health use, it can reduce psychotic symptoms such as hallucinations and delusions.",
